From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bernardo Pereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:47:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Select srcset candidates using sizes and picture source media

`select_image_url` previously ignored `sizes` and `<source media=...>`,
always picking the largest width descriptor regardless of the viewport or
declared slot size.

Evaluate `sizes` (defaulting to `100vw`) against the viewport width and DPR,
picking the smallest width candidate that covers `source_size * dpr` (or the
largest available if none does), and skip `<picture><source>` elements whose
`media` query does not match the viewport.
